Z||000006||Oreif||07-06-2000||02:22 PM||||I don't know! The speedo stops at 120mph but the car keeps going faster.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>So lets see 120 Miles per hour =<BR>60 miles every 30 minutes =<BR>1 mile every 30 seconds =<BR>1/4 mile every 7.5 seconds =<BR>1/8 mile every 3.75 seconds =<BR>176 feet per second! <BR>WOW that's faster than terminal velocity! (120 feet per second)<P><BR>------------------<BR>~Oreif~<BR>Fieroholic and proud of it!<p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 07-06-2000).]||||reg||1
