Z||000022||Taijiguy||07-09-2000||07:45 AM||||What you're saying is very true Eric, and if that's the point Shaun was trying to make, fine. However, there's a good way to go about it, and a not-so-good way. To tell me I'm not "serious" because I don't have the time/energy/desire to trot down to the drag strip and get numbers, or becuase I'd rather spend 130 bucks on something other than a G-Tech. That's the no-so-good way. Your way was much better, and more likely to cultivate a friendly response. ||||reg||1
